      "extract": "When an element X ∈C is used to decorate a framed knot K, the Homﬂy polynomial, P(K; X) ∈Λ, of the decorated knot gives a 2-variable invariant of K determined by X. Each basis element Qλ,µ gives such an invariant of K, and these determine the invariants for all choices of X. When µ = φ these invariants, for each ﬁxed λ, give a family of 1-variable invariants after setting v = s−N which coincide, up to a power of s,",
